abstract: >-
  Kernel-checked Lean 4 / Mathlib proofs of Erdos23.erdos_23.variants.n1,
  Erdos23.blowupC5_tight and Erdos1171.erdos_1171.variants.mono_k from
  google-deepmind/formal-conjectures. These do not resolve Erdős Problem 23 or 1171,
  which remain open.
